// The TOP mapping: includes every domain mapping and carries the
// cross-domain association bindings. Engine-lite let a cross-domain
// AssociationMapping live inside a domain mapping and unioned the
// runtime's mapping list; real Legend (and core) resolves association
// bindings through the INCLUDE closure, so the bindings live where
// both end classes are visible.

